+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
| Running ${PKGSTEM} on OpenBSD
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

To use this with a collection of videos under /var/www/htdocs/videos/,
two things are needed:

- directory auto indexing turned on in httpd.conf:

        location "/videos/*" {
                directory auto index
        }

- player.html or player.min.html symlinked to the desired directory:

    # cd /var/www/player.html && \
        ln -s player.min.html ../htdocs/videos/player.html

Then, navigate to http://example.com/videos/player.html to view the player.
Of course, playback is limited to the container/codec formats supported by
the browser.
